title: "From Absolute Zero: Data science, machine learning, and AI — from no code to transformers and production"
message: "If you use this book or its companion code, please cite it as below."
type: book
authors:
  - family-names: Behara
    given-names: Shanmukh
edition: "First Edition"
year: 2026
isbn: "9798170522552"
# publisher:
