url: "https://github.com/FromAbsoluteZero/CodeBase"
abstract: >-
  A forty-five chapter introduction to data science, machine learning and AI, assuming no
  prior programming, calculus or statistics. Every program in the book was executed and its
  real output printed, including results that contradict the chapter's expectation. Deep
  learning chapters are implemented in pure NumPy so the mechanics remain inspectable.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - data science
  - artificial intelligence
  - deep learning
  - transformers
  - large language models
  - reproducibility
  - algorithmic fairness
  - Python
